# Weekly study routine

## Weekdays: approximately 2--4 hours

  Activity                                                Time
  ----------------------------------------------- ------------
  Recall and review previous material               15--20 min
  Learn new concepts                                45--60 min
  Pen-and-paper mathematics or coding exercises     45--60 min
  Implement a small example                         30--45 min
  Summarize and record mistakes                     10--15 min

## Weekends: approximately 4--7 hours per day

  Activity                                Time
  ------------------------------- ------------
  Deeper concept study              1--2 hours
  Written problem solving           1--2 hours
  Python implementation             1--2 hours
  Weekly review or mini-project         1 hour

Take breaks. A focused 2-hour session is more useful than several hours
of exhausted study.

