# What to implement from scratch

Using libraries is essential in real projects, but implementing small
examples from scratch builds understanding.

  Topic                    Implement
  ------------------------ -----------------------------------------------------
  Descriptive statistics   Mean, variance, standard deviation
  Probability              Coin/dice simulations
  Linear algebra           Dot product and matrix multiplication
  Linear regression        Closed-form solution and gradient descent
  Logistic regression      Sigmoid, log loss, gradient update
  k-Nearest Neighbors      Distance and nearest-neighbour selection
  k-Means                  Assignment and centroid update steps
  Decision tree            A small split using Gini or entropy
  Neural network           Forward pass and backpropagation for a tiny network
  Evaluation               Confusion matrix and classification metrics

Do not try to replace production libraries with your own
implementations. These exercises are for learning and verification.

